WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:06.340
So in the midst of everything going on with
the virus, the 2020 census is also going on.

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:10.260
And there are already discussions of does
the census need to be delayed?

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:11.320
What do we do?

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:14.130
I got my census form last week and I filled
it out.

00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:17.660
I have to tell you, I don't know that I filled
it out correctly.

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:21.650
I don't know that I answered the questions
correctly because of the way that a lot of

00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:23.160
this stuff is structured.

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:25.079
I'll explain to you my confusion.

00:00:25.079 --> 00:00:30.710
I tweeted about this and a ton of people opined
on how I filled out my census form.

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:36.879
So there's a question which asks, are you
of Hispanic, Latino or Spanish origin now

00:00:36.879 --> 00:00:38.430
ethnically?

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:44.519
I'm an Ashkenazi Jew with Eastern European
ancestry and I was born in Argentina.

00:00:44.519 --> 00:00:46.260
I my first language is Spanish.

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:48.790
I moved to the U.S. as an immigrant.

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:54.140
One of the options for this question about
being Hispanic or Latino in origin is, yes,

00:00:54.140 --> 00:00:58.540
another Hispanic, for example, Colombian,
Ecuadorian and presumably Argentinean.

00:00:58.540 --> 00:00:59.540
So I checked.

00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:02.050
Yes, I am Hispanic of other origin.

00:01:02.050 --> 00:01:03.770
And when it has you fill in the detail.

00:01:03.770 --> 00:01:07.410
I put Argentina so far so good.

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:10.020
Then it gets to what is your race?

00:01:10.020 --> 00:01:12.799
White, black or African-American?

00:01:12.799 --> 00:01:14.549
American Indian or Alaska.

00:01:14.549 --> 00:01:16.860
Native, Chinese, Vietnamese.

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:19.970
Some other Asian or some other race.

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:26.439
Now, if you select white, you have to say
what kind of white, what flavor of white are

00:01:26.439 --> 00:01:27.439
you?

00:01:27.439 --> 00:01:29.229
And as examples, it says Irish or German.

00:01:29.229 --> 00:01:33.369
Of course, this is confusing because Irish
and German are also nationalities as much

00:01:33.369 --> 00:01:34.369
as they can be.

00:01:34.369 --> 00:01:35.840
Niceties it could apply to either.

00:01:35.840 --> 00:01:36.850
It's sort of a mess.

00:01:36.850 --> 00:01:40.590
Now, the question of whether Jews are white
is a whole other thing.

00:01:40.590 --> 00:01:44.120
You have a lot of people who say Jews are
white because they pass as white.

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:48.510
Although what about Ms. Rahim and other Jews?

00:01:48.510 --> 00:01:51.720
White supremacists love to say no, Jews are
definitely not white.

00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:54.060
Because if we say they're white, they're like
us.

00:01:54.060 --> 00:01:56.500
If not white, then it would be some other
race.

00:01:56.500 --> 00:02:03.280
So in the end, I put yes, I am white, and
for the type of white I wrote in Ashkenazi

00:02:03.280 --> 00:02:05.619
Jewish, did I do this correctly?

00:02:05.619 --> 00:02:10.550
Should I have put in other race Ashkenazi
Jewish, which of course gets to Ashkenazi

00:02:10.550 --> 00:02:12.069
being an ethnicity?

00:02:12.069 --> 00:02:13.489
Not not really a race.

00:02:13.489 --> 00:02:19.560
So in short, I have no idea if I filled out
my own census form correctly, but it's an

00:02:19.560 --> 00:02:21.640
opportunity to remind you.

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:22.640
Fill out the census.

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:26.310
As of right now, we don't have any indication
the census is being postponed, delayed or

00:02:26.310 --> 00:02:27.420
canceled.

00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:28.420
It's quick.

00:02:28.420 --> 00:02:29.420
It's really important.

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:30.860
I mean, take it's five minutes maybe.

00:02:30.860 --> 00:02:33.670
I think it was more like a minute, 90 seconds.

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:35.800
I know a lot of other things are going on.

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:39.090
The virus, people working from home, losing
jobs, et cetera.

00:02:39.090 --> 00:02:42.890
When you get the form, take the 90 seconds,
fill it out.

00:02:42.890 --> 00:02:46.720
You can do it online or you can fill it out
on paper and mail it back.

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:47.720
And let me know.

00:02:47.720 --> 00:02:52.470
Did I fail my own census form, which would
be very embarrassing.

